Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 09:17:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] README: list all test targets in the Testing section

The Makefile provides make test (unit + e2e) and make test-unit alongside
make test-e2e, but the README's Testing snippet only mentioned the last
one. Show all three so the quick start matches make help.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CWzkSsbvpHy68WHSCysExS
---
 README.md | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 9997cf2..0c32eac 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -29,6 +29,8 @@ bun run build
 
 **Testing:**
 ```bash
+make test      # Run all tests (unit + e2e)
+make test-unit # Run unit tests headlessly
 make test-e2e  # Run Playwright e2e tests
 ```
 
